{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_cast3_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_cast3_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"不朽","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_cast3_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"9684e7b0f15e7af0c2521720fc6e3e85a8d6403759a463eab23250fe2085a005","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"小车个人剧情"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"narration","text":"6:29 A.M. 天氣/陰"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確認環境——距離第1439號塌方位置3.79公里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掃描周圍生命體——八人，隸屬羅德島工程部應急響應施工隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安全等級評定為中低風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，這是個可靠的休息地點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"麻煩你了，Castle-3。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我已經坐下五分鐘了。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，這地方收拾得差不多了，等最前面的勘測小組發回地質報告，我們就準備繼續前進了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"大家辛苦了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"一夜沒睡，真是不容易啊。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是習慣了，只要羅德島行駛在荒原上，就什麼突發情況都可能會有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"為了確保航線通暢，一個月總有那麼幾天得半夜離艦緊急施工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，這回有博士在場，提前排查了好幾處不穩定結構，這效率提升了不少，我估摸著再有個兩三小時，大家就能回艦休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你是不是也很累了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是我應該做的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"難得出來，就當散散心。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，還有Castle-3，你也是大功臣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這一帶沙地獸真是多，你不在的話，光是要把它們都趕走，就得多費很多力氣啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會遵守指令，保障博士和大家的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，你加入工程部門也有三年多了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，距離可露希爾主人第一次啟動我升級後的系統，已經過去三年十個月零九天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼長時間......真是比我們中的很多人都要久了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們準備熱點早飯吃，你要不要一起？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"請給我來一碗湯。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我不餓，喝點水就好。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，我暫時不需要充電。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從剩餘電量來看，本設備還能正常運作八小時十七分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈，本來是想問下你能不能幫忙加熱一下冷凍燻肉，畢竟我們平時和Thermal-EX一起行動慣啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，我的型號不支援上述功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......沒事，我想到了個別的方法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你們誰把剃鬚刀那傢伙的答錄機打開了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"別著急啊，我就是想要點熱量......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那玩意兒年紀可比我們年紀都要大，小心它把我們營地給炸了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這真是答錄機？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"不是源石爆破物吧？！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......從外殼震動頻率來看，該設備的內部電路老化嚴重，有小機率發生自燃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，需不需要我把目標對象抹除？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不著急。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們離遠一點坐吧。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪不朽......不朽......我將成為不朽的怒風......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"快、快按住它，它是不是要散架啦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪不朽......不朽......我將成為不朽的野火......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"誰來救救我，我的耳朵快給震聾了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威脅解除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"可憐的剃鬚刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，這答錄機是徹底壞了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拆除了它的電源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在得到徹底維修之前，我不建議你們繼續使用這台設備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"維修......要是真能修好的話，我們早就動手了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"更不用說剃鬚刀自己......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"有的東西壞了就是壞了，再怎麼想讓它繼續陪著我們，也留不住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"答錄機......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"剃鬚刀......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，博士，答錄機是幹員剃鬚刀的遺物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得剃鬚刀嗎？上次在哥倫比亞，他幫迪倫搶修過“壞傢伙”號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候他還好好的，回來之後不久，病情就急轉直下，沒幾天就走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"他才四十多歲......算了，不說這話。只要得了礦石病，誰都想過會有這一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們吃飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，吃飯......肉還是涼的，不過也沒關係，有的吃就不錯啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"乾了這碗湯吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"敬剃鬚刀。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"不朽......不朽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你這邊吃飯邊敲碗還唱歌，跟剃鬚刀學的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"他活得就像他的答錄機一樣有勁，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......成為一團不朽的野火。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪不朽......不朽......我將成為不朽的野火......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，大家在幹什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"大家在唱歌。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"大家在思念一位老朋友。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"類似行為，我在陪同幹員賈維工作時，也在他身上見過好幾次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，博士，我無法掌握這項技能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾主人為我添加的語言模組，讓我能理解這些詞語的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我並不能體會把這些詞語以上述節奏和高低頻率表達出來，會和直接說出來有什麼差別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"大家在唱歌。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"重要的是情感的抒發。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不朽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同樣不理解這個詞語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼事物是永不損壞的，哪怕是最堅硬的機器也一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":true,"text":"Castle-3！你是不是在附近了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，賈維兄弟，我和博士和施工隊在一起。你們勘測小組是否順利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順利順利，我都準備好了......呃，我是說，工作幹差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，小爺我啊，忘帶扳手了，你過來給我送一下如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賈維兄弟，如果你沒有隨身攜帶重要用具，是如何完成工作的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這你就不用管了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，咳，就昨天我們約好的那個事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指昨天說的，你想申請一次長期外勤，並讓我陪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對對，不過先別說了，博士還在邊上呢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我讓Castle-3過來一趟，你沒意見吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒意見。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"你這表現有點奇怪啊。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，我就知道你一定會批准的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，你趕緊過來吧，我在前面等你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我去給賈維兄弟送工具，您更希望留在這裡，還是和我一起行動？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一起去吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"正好我也想多走幾步。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3還沒回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"算算日子時限差不多快到了，說好了他今天要來找我處理一下的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，剛才我問賈維Castle-3在哪裡，他怎麼表現得奇奇怪怪的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"壞了壞了，他該不會是想偷偷帶Castle-3私奔吧？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，能在這一天和您一起行動，Castle-3感到很愉快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這一天？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Castle-3，你的表現也有點奇怪。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，今天對我來說確實是特別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像剛才幹員們說的那樣，我已經在羅德島上工作很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我同型號的作業平台很少能保持運作更長時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我能看到你身上有很多磨損的痕跡。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"那些標記......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我注意到您在看我身上的刻痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是否想知道它們的由來？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我想知道。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"早就想問了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些刻痕伴隨我走過了這三年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我身上刻下它們的人各不相同，最初那道來自一位年輕的狙擊幹員。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......這些該死的強盜，怎麼這麼多？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......又一個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"想要拿走我身上的資料......沒門！咳......咳咳......該死，剛才那一刀一定是傷到了肺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"過......過來......搭把手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建議您躺下休息。雖然我只是一具作戰平台，但我也能看出來，您的身體狀態已經不適合繼續戰鬥下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"躺下......嗎？不，還不到躺下的時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，你不介意我在你身上留個標記吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種程度的外殼磨損完全不會影響我的功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不明白您的行為有何意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係......咳咳......Castle-3，其實你也知道，我快死了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果無法立刻得到治療，您的身體功能將會在三至五個小時內終止運作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"終止運作嗎......嗯，沒錯，對我們人類來說，這就是死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"你想讓我躺下來，就這樣等著最後一刻到來......我做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"這最後的幾個小時，我必須撐下去，做點什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"——你看這些敵人，他們不光搶羅德島的東西，還一直在騷擾附近的感染者村莊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，在我死前，我要幹掉他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......第三個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"一道刻痕，一次死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"——這是我用我的命換來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕到了最後關頭，這也提醒著我，我的生命和我的死亡，都有意義......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獵弓先生！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後我背著那位幹員衝了出去。很遺憾，在回到羅德島的時候，他的身體功能還是終止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者使用更確切的詞語，他迎來了“死亡”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾主人注意到了我身上的刻痕，她本來想幫我去掉，但我更希望留下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"因為你想紀念那位幹員？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"因為你想紀念那次事件？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，博士，我同樣不能理解“紀念”這個詞語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對機器人來說，只要我的核心一天沒有損壞，我的記憶庫裡就會一直記錄著那次事件，同樣也保存著獵弓先生的所有資料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您想知道我為何決定保留這些刻痕，我很難給出一個精確的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾主人提出過一個可能性——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說，我是在“模仿”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你在模仿那位幹員？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你在模仿刻痕行為？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾主人給我們這些機器都設計了這部分模組，她希望我們的行為舉止能更接近人類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我並不能完全理解獵弓先生留下的刻痕的具體意義，但我的程式功能讓我決定延續他的行為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那次事件之後，我每次外出執行作戰任務，都會計數自己擊退了多少敵人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並在結束後拜託同行幹員，請他們在我的外殼上刻下相應數量的痕跡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你是在學習。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我不像Thermal-EX，我不會發熱，我的程式也並不支援我進行“學習”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到今天，我得出了一個並不確切的結論：獵弓先生留下來的刻痕，可能和剃鬚刀先生的答錄機是類似的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像在本設備不得不停止工作後，我佈滿刻痕的外殼也許仍然能存在一段時間，無論是在垃圾場，還是在可露希爾主人的私人倉庫裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我更希望它留在特殊儲物間裡。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我會懷念與你一起經歷的每一場戰鬥。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我的核心停止了運作，我記憶庫裡的資料也會被清除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但您今天告訴我的這些話，對我來說有很大意義。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3！你到哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"施工隊的人越來越近，等他們都到了，事情就麻煩了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，剛才可露希爾發來消息，她問我你是不是跟我在一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，我們再不跑就來不及了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賈維兄弟，我沒有明白——什麼來不及了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此外，我聽到扳手的聲音了。這是否可以說明，其實你並不需要我給你送工具？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是個藉口......別管那麼多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就聽可露希爾說了，你的核心馬上就要壞了吧？她是不是打算把你報廢了，就跟以前我們廠裡報廢那些發動機壞了的車一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你的意思是，主人是否會在今天停止我的功能的話，確實有這個可能性。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"什麼？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我本應早點向你說明，可我判斷，任務是第一優先。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以你主動提出和我一起出來？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"所以你今天的表現也不太對勁。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到最後一刻，Castle-3都會是您最堅實的夥伴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":true,"text":"......那是不是博士的聲音？博士為什麼也在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，我讓你一個人，不是，一個機器自己過來的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士在的話，我怎麼帶你跑？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賈維兄弟，我昨天就已經對你說過了，讓我陪你出長期外勤這個提議，幾乎不可能實行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為一台機器，可露希爾主人以及博士的指令是最優先的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我的核心堅持不了多久，你所描繪的我們一起跑好幾個國家的情形，是無法實現的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑不了多遠，我們也可以跑啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越是命不久矣，就越要及時行樂——在自由奔跑的途中倒下，總比今天就回去，在車間裡變成一堆廢鐵要快樂吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大不了回來之後被奧斯塔嘮叨一會，再被可露希爾暴揍一頓......都先不管了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士，你也說句話啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我覺得賈維說的對。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Castle-3，你怎麼想？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通訊完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，Castle-3——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，你怎麼突然......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我的感測器偵測到了危險單位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——沙地獸，一共四頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，等您下令。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，左邊！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"距離最近的目標已倒下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，後方岩石背面還有五頭沙地獸，正在朝我們靠近！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，攻擊左前方三十度的石壁！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遵命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岩壁碎裂，博士小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"災害帶來的也不全是麻煩。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，從這裂口出去！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，博士，請坐到我身上來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您一定要坐穩了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，最高速度，前進！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們甩脫那群沙地獸了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，你幹得很好。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Castle-3，你沒有減速。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您先不要下來，只要Castle-3保持當前速度，我們就能在十分鐘後抵達本艦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你不去找賈維嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這是自由的反方向。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我聽懂了賈維兄弟的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是希望我能在最後的時間裡，自由地奔跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們此刻不正在奔跑嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"確實是在奔跑。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"風好大。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，能和您一起奔跑，Castle-3真的非常愉快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不朽......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這時候好像很適合唱歌。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我將成為不朽的怒風。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我將成為不朽的野火。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，這又是模仿？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Castle-3，你學會唱歌了。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺到了我的輪子碾過荒地，風拍打著我的外殼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有電流通過我的核心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您讓我感受到了節奏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以為您用電流聲伴奏了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"繼續奔跑吧，Castle-3。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪我將成為不朽的野火”\n“♪我將成為不朽的怒風”\n“♪從我的肋骨間跑出一群馱獸”\n“♪威風凜凜地衝向荒原”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3......咦，博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾主人，我沒有遲到吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有啊，Castle-3，你一直是最守時的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的主人，從始至終，Castle-3都不會讓您失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我跟您去工作間之前，我想再跟博士說幾句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題啊，我又不趕時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝您選擇Castle-3。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與您並肩經歷的每一場戰鬥，都是我的榮幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，進入休眠模式。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"居然自己關機了......博士，今天你們一起做了什麼啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們一起完成了一個任務。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們一起經歷了一場冒險。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們一起合唱了一首歌。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"我也說不上來哪裡有些奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3還是Castle-3，不像Lancet-2那樣偶爾會說一些傷感的話，也不像Thermal-EX，動不動嚇我一跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"非要說的話......好像變得更帥氣了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"或許他學會了“死亡”的概念。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"或許他感到了“生命”的不朽。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"或許他為自己身為機器人的一生感到滿意。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我很驚訝，但我說不好是因為你在Castle-3身上看到了這些，還是因為Castle-3竟然讓你看到了這些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有什麼區別？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"因為偶爾我會有一種感覺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"當智慧型機器人們使用著我們的語言，嘗試理解著我們的行為與思想時，我們是不是也在透過他們看自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，突然說這種深沉的話，也太不像我了吧！{@nickname}博士，你真的不考慮和我一起研究智慧生命對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不考慮。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"有機會再說吧。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......跟你說完這些，我又有了一些新思路......博士，我帶Castle-3回去了啊，今天的工作還挺麻煩的呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"快看看誰來了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，等候您的命令。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，你沒事？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你的記憶庫還在嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經運行了三次自我檢測程式，沒有發現任何記憶文件丟失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那真是太好了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我早就知道可露希爾不會輕易讓你報廢的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不枉小爺我急急忙忙趕回來......可累壞我了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"本來想著能不能多留Castle-3一會，沒想到一回來就見他被大卸八塊，當時我就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就急了？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"就哭了？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"......就差點朝可露希爾大喊大叫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賈維兄弟，根據工程部門同事的描述來看，你的行為並不能用“差點”來形容。我記憶庫裡儲存的粗口集錦都不及你的語言豐富......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了夠了，快別說了，那還不是因為我擔心你嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"雖說腦門上給可露希爾揍出來的包還在痛......可小爺我一點都不後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"你們幾個可是我在島上認識的最親的小弟，也就比奧斯塔和布洛卡他們差一點，當然一個都不能少！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，賈維兄弟，你也是我的好小弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"這還差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不對啊，誰是誰小弟？Castle-3，你學壞了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼不記得我和可露希爾有改你性格......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賈維兄弟，本設備並不具備“學壞”的功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧行吧，總之，博士，你看到了啊，這傢伙剛醒過來就想來找你，讓你知道下他沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"結果就是，我們都沒鬧明白。可露希爾已經準備好了一整套升級系統，可以讓Castle-3的核心繼續跑個——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道能跑多久，說不定比小爺我剩下的時間還要久吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賈維兄弟，我相信，你也還能自由奔跑很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我們會一起陪著博士，而博士也會陪著我們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們一起。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我不會放手。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，博士，可露希爾主人為我添加了歌曲播放功能，賈維兄弟給我更新了一下曲庫，我現在會唱的歌變多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——您想聽《火山大噴發之後最偉大的奇觀》，還是《你嘗起來是這麼美味》？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_007_closre","aliases":["可露希爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["工程幹員B"]},{"speakerId":"char_349_chiave","aliases":["賈維"]}]}
